# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# 构建产物:根目录 APK + releases/ 下的 APK。
# APK 只放腾讯云 COS 当更新源,不进 git(git 仅作源码备份),避免仓库被二进制撑爆。
/app-release.apk
/releases/*.apk
